implementationPlan.description:
In `service.go:143`, replace `hash, _ := snapshotHash(result)` with proper error handling. Since the function returns `(*EffectiveSnapshot, error)`, propagate the error:
```go
hash, err := snapshotHash(result)
if err != nil {
    return nil, fmt.Errorf("snapshot hash: %w", err)
}
```
This ensures callers know when config change detection is broken rather than silently using an empty hash.
